The Laplace approximation
\series default
\color inherit
 of the log marginal likelihood:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\ln\hat{p}(\mathbf{y})\approx\ln p(\mathbf{y}|\tilde{\theta})+\text{ln}p(\tilde{\theta})+\frac{1}{2}\ln\left\vert J_{\mathbf{y}}^{-1}(\tilde{\theta})\right\vert +\frac{p}{2}\ln(2\pi),
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $p$
\end_inset

 is the number of unrestricted parameters.
 
